      "language": "javascript",
      "summary": "公开工作区包元数据聚合模块。调用 findPackageDirectories 发现包目录，读取每个 package.json，过滤掉私有包，返回包含 name、version、directory 的对象数组。是发布和版本管理脚本的核心数据源。",
      "tags": ["script", "workspace", "release-infrastructure", "package-metadata"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:scripts/publish-release-announcement.mjs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "publish-release-announcement.mjs",
      "filePath": "scripts/publish-release-announcement.mjs",
      "language": "javascript",
      "summary": "版本发布公告脚本。验证所有公开工作区包已发布到 npm registry（带重试机制），构造发布记录 JSON，通过 AWS S3 API 上传到 releases/ 目录并原子性地更新 latest.json 指针文件。使用 ETag 条件写入防止并发冲突，支持最多 5 次重试的乐观锁机制。导出 compareReleaseVersions 和 advanceLatestRelease 供测试使用。",
      "tags": ["script", "release", "npm", "s3", "ci-cd", "version-management"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
